tmas and Edmond has not written a single word.","tagline":"He's got three weeks to write a masterpiece…"},{"language":"fr-FR","overview":"Paris, Décembre 1897. Edmond Rostand n’a pas encore trente ans mais déjà deux enfants et beaucoup d’angoisses. Il n’a rien écrit depuis deux ans. En désespoir de cause, il propose au grand Constant Coquelin une pièce nouvelle, une comédie héroïque, en vers, pour les fêtes. Seul souci : elle n’est pas encore écrite.","tagline":"Il a 3 semaines pour écrire un chef d'oeuvre. Il n'a que le titre : Cyrano de Bergerac"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/n467qssqjHcrTzvN1pGBQi6mOgJ.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/flqONlzGNUkGCJr9BfBhGNLYo6B.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":544510,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"fr-FR","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/n467qssqjHcrTzvN1pGBQi6mOgJ.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/n467qssqjHcrTzvN1pGBQi6mOgJ.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/n467qssqjHcrTzvN1pGBQi6mOgJ.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/n467qssqjHcrTzvN1pGBQi6mOgJ.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4ZvABkKicSmsjww4tzSjtHDsDA4.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4ZvABkKicSmsjww4tzSjtHDsDA4.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9Y1VxSfJdu8fqQqgX0x6OObxvUw.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9Y1VxSfJdu8fqQqgX0x6OObxvUw.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9Y1VxSfJdu8fqQqgX0x6OObxvUw.jpg","previe